# Bilingual localization (EN + FR)

Whenever you add or change any user-facing text in this app:

1. Add/update the key in **both** `lib/l10n/app_en.arb` and `lib/l10n/app_fr.arb`.
2. Never hardcode UI strings in Dart widgets — use `AppLocalizations.of(context)!`.
3. After editing `.arb` files, run `flutter gen-l10n` so generated files stay in sync.
4. Keep EN and FR key sets identical (same keys, same placeholders).
5. Prefer clear natural translations (not literal word-for-word) for French.
